      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَقْزِيحٌ</span></b>  <i>A thing upon the head of a plant</i> or
<i>tree,</i> (K, TA,) <i>that divides into several divisions,</i>
(K, * TA,) <i>like the paw of the dog:</i> (K, TA:) a
subst. like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَمْتِينٌ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَنْبِيتٌ</span>. (TA.)

